pair_target.description:
The switch stores the pairing and controls the light directly, without Home Assistant. The top button switches on (hold: dim up), the bottom one off (hold: dim down).

Paired from Home Assistant (pairings made in the SG app are not shown):
- Left rocker: {left}
- Right rocker: {right}

Only lights set up the same way as the switch are listed: both moved from the SG gateway, or both added by Home Assistant.
